The environment provides telemetry for several important Windows and
Active Directory security events.

| Event ID | Description | Security Use |
|---:|---|---|
| `4624` | Successful logon | Authentication monitoring |
| `4625` | Failed logon | Failed authentication detection |
| `4672` | Special privileges assigned | Privileged account monitoring |
| `4720` | User created | Account creation detection |
| `4726` | User deleted | Account lifecycle monitoring |
| `4728` | Global group member added | Privilege/group monitoring |
| `4729` | Global group member removed | Privilege/group monitoring |
| `4732` | Local group member added | Local privilege monitoring |
| `4740` | Account locked out | Authentication attack detection |

